  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "むかし　とおい　とちから　やってきてすみついた。　はねから　ぶんぴつするジェルは　みずと　よごれを　はじく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "옛날에 머나먼 땅에서 찾아와 정착했다. 날개에서 분비되는 젤은 물과 먼지를 튕겨 낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "很久以前從遠方來到了這裡棲息。羽毛分泌出的凝膠有防水和防污的效果。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Originaire d’une contrée lointaine, il est venu s’installer dans la région il y a longtemps. Ses ailes sécrètent un gel qui repousse l’eau et les saletés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vor langer Zeit kam es von weit her und ließ sich in Paldea nieder. Über sein Gefieder sondert es ein Gel ab, das Wasser und Schmutz abweist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon llegado hace tiempo desde tierras lejanas y ya establecido en la región. El gel que secreta por las plumas repele el agua y la mugre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Giunto da lontano, si è stabilito nella regione in tempi antichi. Le sue piume secernono un gel che lo protegge dall’acqua e dallo sporco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon migrated to Paldea from distant lands long ago. The gel secreted by its feathers repels water and grime.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "昔　遠い　土地から　やって来て棲みついた。　羽から　分泌するジェルは　水と　汚れを　弾く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "很久以前从远方的土地来到这里栖息。羽毛分泌出的凝胶有防水和防污的效果。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon llegado hace tiempo desde tierras lejanas y ya establecido en la región. El gel que secreta por las plumas repele el agua y la mugre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ながれが　きゅうな　かわもじゆうに　およぎまわる　きゃくりょくを　もつ。きれいずきで　おもいこみが　つよい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "유속이 빠른 강에서도 자유롭게 헤엄칠 수 있는 다릿심을 가졌다. 깔끔한 것을 좋아하며 집착이 강하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有在水流湍急的河川也能自在游動的腳力。愛乾淨，個性不知變通。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon perfectionniste aime la propreté. Ses pattes puissantes lui permettent de nager avec aisance, même lorsque le courant est fort.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine Beine sind so kräftig, dass es auch in Flüssen mit starker Strömung frei schwimmen kann. Es ist ordnungsliebend und starrsinnig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La fuerza de sus patas le permite nadar incluso por las más fuertes corrientes fluviales. Adora la pulcritud y peca de inflexible en su actitud.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può nuotare tranquillamente persino nei fiumi più impetuosi grazie ai potenti arti inferiori. Tiene molto alla pulizia ed è incline a rimuginare.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its strong legs let it easily swim around in even fast-flowing rivers. It likes to keep things tidy and is prone to overthinking things.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "流れが　急な　川も自由に　泳ぎまわる　脚力を　持つ。きれい好きで　思い込みが　強い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "脚力之强，即使在水流湍急的河川也能自在游动。爱干净，性格有些顽固。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La fuerza de sus patas le permite nadar incluso por las más fuertes corrientes fluviales. Adora la pulcritud y peca de inflexible en su actitud.",
      "language": {
